.DS_Store

# Reference photographs of the printed boards. Local only, and deliberately
# so: the layouts are reproduced as functional tile data, never as scans, and
# a public repo is the last place a photograph of someone else's board art
# belongs. `git add -A` will otherwise happily stage the lot.
maps/
manual*/
rules/
# .claude/ is local, except the skills a cloud session needs (games-meta STANDARD.md §12).
# Last in the file so no rule above can hide part of a skill.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
.claude/skills/**/.DS_Store
